@FIXTURE_SNAKE_ONLY_COMMANDS
; engine-compat mini fixture: snake-only display/audio commands.
; SETBGIMAGE / PLAYBGM exist in the snake (4.9xx) command surface but are
; absent from the v24_1824 command surface, so compiling this file under
; the v24 profile must take the engine-profile rejection path, while the
; default (no --engine-profile) path compiles it unchanged.
SETBGIMAGE "fixture_bg.png"
PLAYBGM "fixture_bgm.ogg"
PRINTL snake-only command file executed
